     * @param limit  the maximum number of items to return (must be non‑negative)
     * @param offset the starting index (must be non‑negative)
     * @param <T>    the type of elements in the list
     * @return a new {@link List} containing the requested slice; if {@code offset} is beyond the end of the list,
     * an empty list is returned
     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if {@code limit} or {@code offset} is negative
