     * is called with the supplied {@code responseType} and a success message. If the task throws
     * an exception, the exception is forwarded to the registered {@code errorHandler} (if any).
     *
     * @param task          the task to run asynchronously
     * @param responseType  the response type to use when reporting success
     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if {@code task} or {@code responseType} is {@code null}
