/**
 * A simple deterministic finite automaton (DFA) implementation.
 *
 * <p>The DFA automatically builds its alphabet from all symbols used in transitions.
 * When {@link #addTransition(State, char, State)} is called, the symbol is added to the
 * DFA's alphabet set.
 *
 * <p>Usage example:
 * <pre>
 *     // Create states
 *     State q0 = new State("q0");
 *     State q1 = new State("q1");
 *
 *     // Build DFA
 *     DFA dfa = new DFA();
 *     dfa.addState(q0);          // first added state becomes the initial state
